Franka Panda simulation environment

Project packages declare Apache-2.0, except panda_rviz (BSD-3-Clause). See LICENSE
and src/panda_rviz/LICENSE.

Vendored model and meshes:
  MuJoCo Menagerie / franka_emika_panda
  https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco_menagerie/tree/cda5236f98383f6fbaa4820c6b18dba892cd087f/franka_emika_panda
  Apache-2.0; license retained at src/panda_description/mjcf/LICENSE.
  Local modifications are listed in src/panda_description/mjcf/UPSTREAM.md.

Adapted semantic robot configuration:
  MoveIt Resources / panda_moveit_config
  https://github.com/moveit/moveit_resources/tree/e1657c128ea61621777a041e3783c9c7c93db4ca/panda_moveit_config
  Apache-2.0; license retained at src/panda_bringup/config/LICENSE.
  The SRDF was adapted for the TCP chain, ready state and movable hand group.

Franka message interfaces:
  https://github.com/lvjonok/pixi_panda_ros2/tree/167960fbd64d52c7fa31eeb70babfe65f2416062
  franka_msgs declares Apache-2.0 and retains its upstream copyright notices.

Other dependencies, including ROS, MoveIt, MuJoCo and libfranka, are fetched
at image build time and retain their respective upstream licenses. Pinned
versions and commits are recorded in versions.lock.yaml.

MuJoCo runtime overlay:
  https://github.com/ros-controls/mujoco_ros2_control/tree/178b1c39e5010185116bc89b4e94cbb25b825f61
  Apache-2.0; upstream copyright notices are retained in the patched source.
  container/patches/mujoco-runtime.patch adds readiness gating, reset coordination
  and low-rate frozen-state publication for late subscribers.
  Its lodepng dependency is pinned; LODEPNG_LICENSE is retained in the installed package share directory.

RViz image display extension:
  https://github.com/ros2/rviz/tree/e2e1a1562ae5a99975ec4052856064becec9da0c
  src/panda_rviz extends the RViz 14.1.24 Image display using its protected API.
  BSD-3-Clause; Willow Garage (2012), Bosch Software Innovations (2017),
  TNG Technology Consulting (2020).
  The original license is retained in src/panda_rviz/LICENSE.
  Local changes clear a disconnected image callback before its filter is destroyed.

Student runtime patch:
  container/patches/student-state.patch removes the free-joint editing service
  and restricts reset requests to an unmodified initial-state reset. Apache-2.0.
